#: /data00/home/youthlin.chen/go/src/github.com/youthlin/blog/web/templates/admin_import.gohtml:10
msgid "导入 WordPress XML"
msgstr "Import WordPress XML"

#: /data00/home/youthlin.chen/go/src/github.com/youthlin/blog/web/templates/admin_import.gohtml:11
msgid "上传 WXR 导出 XML，并选择导入后文章/页面归属到哪个后台用户。"
msgstr ""
"Upload a WXR export XML file and choose which admin user imported posts/"
"pages should belong to."

#: /data00/home/youthlin.chen/go/src/github.com/youthlin/blog/web/templates/admin_import.gohtml:12
msgid ""
"注意：如果数据库中已存在相同 ID 的文章、页面或评论，本次提交会按 upsert 覆盖"
"保存。"
msgstr ""
"Note: if posts, pages, or comments with the same ID already exist, this "
"import overwrites them via upsert."

#: /data00/home/youthlin.chen/go/src/github.com/youthlin/blog/web/templates/admin_import.gohtml:35
msgid "导入行为"
msgstr "Import behavior"

#: /data00/home/youthlin.chen/go/src/github.com/youthlin/blog/web/templates/admin_import.gohtml:37
msgid "分类、标签会按原始 ID upsert 保存。"
msgstr "Categories and tags are saved by original ID using upsert."

#: /data00/home/youthlin.chen/go/src/github.com/youthlin/blog/web/templates/admin_import.gohtml:38
msgid "文章、页面会按原始 WordPress `post_id` upsert 保存。"
msgstr ""
"Posts and pages are saved by original WordPress `post_id` using upsert."

#: /data00/home/youthlin.chen/go/src/github.com/youthlin/blog/web/templates/admin_import.gohtml:39
msgid "所有导入的文章/页面作者都会改为你在表单中选择的用户。"
msgstr ""
"All imported posts/pages will be reassigned to the user selected in the form."

#: /data00/home/youthlin.chen/go/src/github.com/youthlin/blog/web/templates/admin_import.gohtml:40
msgid "评论会保留原始评论作者信息，并按评论 ID upsert 保存。"
msgstr ""
"Comments keep the original author info and are saved by comment ID using "
"upsert."

#: /data00/home/youthlin.chen/go/src/github.com/youthlin/blog/web/templates/admin_import.gohtml:41
msgid "非 `post` / `page` 类型内容不会导入。"
msgstr "Content types other than `post` / `page` are ignored."

#: /data00/home/youthlin.chen/go/src/github.com/youthlin/blog/web/templates/admin_import.gohtml:65
msgid "导出 XML"
msgstr "Export XML"

#: /data00/home/youthlin.chen/go/src/github.com/youthlin/blog/web/templates/admin_import.gohtml:66
msgid "导出后可直接在本页重新导入，用于迁移或备份。"
msgstr ""
"The exported XML can be re-imported on this page for migration or backup."

#: /data00/home/youthlin.chen/go/src/github.com/youthlin/blog/web/templates/admin_import.gohtml:67
msgid ""
"说明：若只勾选“评论”而不勾选文章/页面，无法形成可回导 XML，因此提交时会提示错"
"误。"
msgstr ""
"If only comments are selected without posts/pages, a re-importable XML "
"cannot be generated, so the submission will fail."

#: /data00/home/youthlin.chen/go/src/github.com/youthlin/blog/web/templates/admin_import.gohtml:71
msgid "选择要导出的内容"
msgstr "Choose content to export"

